{'symbol': 'CI', 'date': '2023-03-01 16:44:00', 'title': "AM BEST ASSIGNS ISSUE CREDIT RATINGS TO THE CIGNA GROUP'S NEW SENIOR UNSECURED NOTES", 'text': 'OLDWICK, N.J.--(BUSINESS WIRE)-- #INSURANCE--AM BEST HAS ASSIGNED A LONG-TERM ISSUE CREDIT RATING OF “BBB” (GOOD) TO THE $700 MILLION, 5.685% SENIOR UNSECURED NOTES DUE MARCH 15, 2026, AND THE $800 MILLION, 5.4% SENIOR UNSECURED NOTES DUE MARCH 15, 2033, RECENTLY ISSUED BY THE CIGNA GROUP (CIGNA) (HEADQUARTERED IN BLOOMFIELD, CT) [NYSE:CI]. THE OUTLOOK ASSIGNED TO THESE CREDIT RATINGS (RATINGS) IS POSITIVE. THE EXISTING RATINGS OF CIGNA AND ITS SUBSIDIARIES ARE UNCHANGED.'}